  lessons:
  - Follow the checking steps, even when someone important is rushing you.
  - Don't click "Enable Content" on unexpected attachments.
  - Know that personal details can come from public pages and don't prove who sent
    a message.
  - Read what an app asks for before you click Allow.
  - Double-check risky requests another way, even from trusted accounts.
  - Fix risks by how likely and how harmful they are.
